  "_meta": {
    "subsystem": "interior_lights",
    "source": "sheets 460-473 (=11 INTERIOR LIGHTS); detail sheets 464-469 standard, 470-473 options",
    "voltage": 24,
    "note": "Interior cabin lighting. Master fuse -F17 25A on +MSB feeds the INTLT_POS distribution bus; per-area fuses -FX14/-FX15/-FX16/-FX17/-FX18 hang off INTLT_POS and feed each area's switch panel and light groups. Night light is a separate circuit: -FX03 5A fed from the F90_POS bus, not INTLT_POS. Option sheets 470-473 are alternative-configuration variants of the same fuses/switches/light groups (extra harness/dimmer variants e.g. -U4116/-U4152) and add no new switched groups. Negative returns go to XNEG. Light groups are aggregated per switched circuit; distinct switched groups within an area (ceiling vs indirect vs wall/reading vs toilet) are kept as separate loads where the panel shows separate switches."
  },
